I found one substantive local-gate issue in the prior implementation: its guess sampler enforced answer size but not the explicit first-moment equality. The task specifically calls out sum constraints as “free” structure, so the reported 0/200,000 rate was too optimistic. I’m measuring the correct first-moment-conditioned candidate language before changing the module.
