+The panel did not independently run LLL, an ILP solver, or an SMT solver because the module is dependency-free; instead it includes a complete exact meet-in-the-middle algorithm for the bounded shipping language, which is stronger than a failed relaxation at this size. A solver that recognizes the complete Boolean cube can recover the answer cheaply. Finally, the OpenRouter account failure means G9(b) and the bare multi-vendor hardening verdict are absent: `selftest_report.json` therefore says `all_passed=false`, and this directory must not be submitted as a completed hard family until those script-owned runs succeed.
