\end{example}
To date, 33 distinct types of ideal non-negative integer solutions of GPTE have been identified with \( k_1 < 0 \) and \( k_n > 0 \). For example,
\begin{align}
& [77, 1057, 1661]^k = [91, 143, 1963]^k, \quad (k = -2, 2) \tag*{\eqref{k2n2s1963}} \\
