The author discovered the above formulas in 2019 \cite{Chen19}. These formulas can be derived from \refIdentity{identity_GNI2} and can also be verified by using the ideal integer solutions for the following types:  $(h=1,2,3,5), (h=0,1,2,4), (h=-1,0,1,3), (h=-2,-1,0,2)$, and $(h=-3,-2,-1,1)$. (See \ref{h1235}, \ref{h0124}, \ref{h013n1}, \ref{h02n12}, \ref{h1n123})


