4184:Research on the PTE Problem has traditionally been conducted within the scope of integers. In 2021, the author discovered a series of identities \cite{Chen21}, thereby extending the exploration of ideal solutions for the PTE Problem and the GPTE Problem into the realm of trigonometric functions.
