The final documentation now distinguishes the paper’s ideal symmetric definition from this larger non-ideal PTE family, and the certificate grammar correctly covers both the 16-row demo and 64-row shipping cases. One last full self-test is running after those module-level changes; afterward I’ll only reconcile measured timing text and perform read-only validation.
