Completed the self-contained Track B generator for the [PTE survey](https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.11429).

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2506.11429/gen_2506_11429.py:1)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2506.11429/README.md:1)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2506.11429/selftest_report.json)
- [Bare oracle transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2506.11429/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2506.11429/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2506.11429/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Key results:

- All nine gates pass.
- Shipping preset: `hard`, with 480-bit weights and scale.
- Exact density: 2 valid witnesses among 601,080,390 candidates.
- Reference algorithm: 589,914 operations, 0.29883 seconds.
- Structural route: 127 exact operations.
- Answer: 64-symbol A/B coloring, 66 serialized characters.
- Bare oracle: 0/3 solved at shipping.
- G9: hinted 1/3, placebo 1/3; measured difference `0.0`.
